WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.340
In a Theravada Buddhist
family, a grandparent has died.

2
00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.950
After a death, the family
give food and robes to monks,

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.900
in their relative's name.

4
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:15.070
Yet an old Buddhist verse says:
by oneself one is purified.

5
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.550
No one can purify another.

6
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.560
So can one person's good
deeds help someone else?

7
00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.940
In this mission, you'll meet
three great bodhisattvas,

8
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:28.460
of compassion, wisdom,
and the Buddha to come.

9
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:32.970
Then you'll test the sharing of merit
against the teaching that each person reaps

10
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.730
their own karma.

11
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.390
Your mission: find out whether one
person's good deeds can help someone else.
